<p>Hello, this is a thread for reviewing my SCP. I don't require any greenlights as I already own an SCP on the main-site.<br />
The link to the sandbox &#8212;&gt; <a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/maskedn00b3">http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/maskedn00b3</a></p>
<p>Please give constructive feedback!</p>
<p>Current word count <strong>3.3k</strong></p>
<p><strong>PLEASE DO NOT CRIT ON THE DRAFT YET. A FEW CHANGES MUST BE MADE.</strong></p>

